– Deals 5d6 fire damage and Stuns on a failed Saving Throw vs. Breath at -2. If the target dies, an explosion occurs inflicting the same effects to all creatures in a 5-ft. radius.

THAC0: +4
Damage: 1d4+4 (missile)
Speed Factor: 0
